<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43842" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐεργετ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>productive of benefit, beneficent</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠφέλιμα καὶ εὐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1388b12
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Piet.</u>
				11
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόξα εὐ</span>. a
			reputation <i>for beneficence</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1361a28
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρετὴ δύναμις εὐ. πολλῶν καὶ
				μεγάλων</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1366a38
			</span></i>: c. gen.pers., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιλανθρωπία ἕξις εὐ. ἀνθρώπων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Def.</u>
					412e
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ εὐ</span>.
			<i>beneficence</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				1.25
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ -ώτερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					6.9.8
				</span></i>
			; of persons, <i>beneficent, bountiful</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐεργετικὸν</span> (v.l.
				-<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τητικὸν</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> εἶναι καλόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1171b16
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. χρηστὸς φιλάνθρωπος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Muson.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					8p.39H.
				</span></i>
			: 
				Sup.
			 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ώτατος</span>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, εἰς τοὺς Ἕλληνας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					7.8.6
				</span></i>
			. Adv. -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶς, διακείμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					90.11
				</span></i>
			 (Rosetta, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
			</span></i> V), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				5(2).266.13
			</span></i> (Mantinea, <span class="entity">i B. C.</span>).</div>
